{"id":"word:hebrew:H4609","type":"word","title":"מַעֲלָה","subtitle":"H4609 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"elevation , i.e. the act (literally, a journey to a higher place, figuratively, a thought arising), or (concretely) the condition (literally, a step or grade -mark, figuratively, a superiority of station); specifically a climactic progression (in certain Psalms)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מַעֲלָה (H4609) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 50 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מַעֲלָה (maʻălâh) means elevation , i.e. the act (literally, a journey to a higher place, figuratively, a thought arising), or (concretely) the condition (literally, a step or grade -mark, figuratively, a superiority of station); specifically a climactic progression (in certain Psalms) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 17 17."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מַעֲלָה","transliteration":"maʻălâh","pronunciation":"mah-al-aw'","strong":"H4609","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4609","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַֽ/מַּ֫עֲל֥וֹת","מַעֲלֽוֹת","הַֽ/מַּעֲל֗וֹת","הַֽ/מַּעֲלָ֖ה","מַעֲל֣וֹת"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncfpa",19],["HNcfpa",11],["HRd/Ncfpa",3],["HTd/Ncfsa",2],["HR/Ncfpc",2],["HNcfpc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncfpc/Sp3ms",2],["HC/Ncfpa",2],["HR/Ncfpa",1],["HC/Ncfpc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"elevation , i.e. the act (literally, a journey to a higher place, figuratively, a thought arising), or (concretely) the condition (literally, a step or grade -mark, figuratively, a superiority of station); specifically a climactic progression (in certain Psalms)","usage":"things that come up, (high) degree, deal, go up, stair, step, story.","full":"H4609. ma 'alah I. [ מַעֲלָה ] noun feminine what comes up ; — plural construct רוּחֲכֶם מַעֲלוֺת Ezek 11:5 , i.e. your thoughts. II. מַעֲלָה 46 noun feminine step, stair ; — ׳מ Ezra 7:9 ; 1Chr 17:17 ; plural מַעֲלוֺת Isa 38:8 +, suffix מַעֲלֹתָו֯ Amos 9:6 , etc.; &#8212; 1 step, stair of temple Ezek 40:6 5 t. 40, and temple porch 40:49 ; of altar Exod 20:26 (E) (forbidden, compare RS OTJC xii, n. l; 2nd ed. 358 ) Ezek 43:17 (prescribed); of house 2Kin 9:13 , of throne 1Kin 10:19-20 , 2Chr 9:18-19 , to the city of David Neh 3:15 ; 12:37 . 2 steps (forming sun-dial, compare Di Is ) 2Kin 20:9 (twice in verse); 20:10 (twice in verse); 20:11 (3 t. in verse) = Isa 38:8 (5 t. in verse) 3 stories of heaven Amos 9:6 . 4 ascent , מִבָּבֶל Ezra 7:9 . 5 . שִׁיר (ל)הַמַּעֲלוֺת song of ascents, to the three great pilgrim feasts, i.e. to be sung on way up to Jerusalem, titles of Psalm 120-134 + Psa 84:6 We and others — המעלה האדם כְּתוֺר 1Chr 17:17 is corrupt, see Commentaries on the passage (and on || 2Sam 7:19 ).","rootNote":"feminine of 4608 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 17 17","keyReferences":["1Chr 17 17","1Kgs 10 19","1Kgs 10 20","2Chr 9 18","2Chr 9 19","2Kgs 9 13","2Kgs 20 9","2Kgs 20 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":50,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 17 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מַּעֲלָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 10 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַעֲל֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 10 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מַּעֲל֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 9 18","book":"2Chr","chapter":9,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַעֲל֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 9 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":9,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מַּעֲל֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 13","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מַּעֲל֑וֹת","sourc